  "domain": "machine-learning",
  "definition": "A neural network component within a multimodal architecture that transforms raw input from one particular modality \u2014 text, image, audio, video, depth, or sensor streams \u2014 into a dense embedding using an architecture suited to that modality's structure, such as a Transformer for tokenised text or a Vision Transformer for image patches. The resulting per-modality representations are projected into a shared latent space where fusion, alignment, or cross-modal conditioning can occur.",
